34269.a:
**Qisqa javob:** Variable turlari: oddiy (`string`, `number`, `bool`) va murakkab (`list`, `set`, `map`, `object`, `tuple`). `type` noto'g'ri qiymatni ushlaydi, `validation` bloki esa biznes qoidasini (ruxsat etilgan qiymatlar, format) plan bosqichida tekshiradi.

**Amalda:**
```hcl
variable "env" {
  type = string
  validation {
    condition     = contains(["dev", "stage", "prod"], var.env)
    error_message = "env dev, stage yoki prod bo'lishi kerak."
  }
}

variable "instance_count" {
  type    = number
  default = 2
  validation {
    condition     = var.instance_count >= 1 && var.instance_count <= 10
    error_message = "1 dan 10 gacha."
  }
}

variable "tags" {
  type    = map(string)
  default = {}
}

variable "db" {
  type = object({
    engine  = string
    size_gb = number
    backup  = optional(bool, true)   # ixtiyoriy maydon, default bilan
  })
}
```
Noto'g'ri qiymat:
```bash
terraform plan -var env=production
# Error: Invalid value for variable
#   env dev, stage yoki prod bo'lishi kerak.
```

**Turlar jadvali:**
| Tur | Misol |
|---|---|
| `list(string)` | `["a", "b"]` (tartib bor, takror mumkin) |
| `set(string)` | takrorsiz, `for_each` uchun |
| `map(number)` | `{ a = 1 }` |
| `object({...})` | aniq maydonli tuzilma |

**Tuzoqlar:**
- `type = any` — xatolar plan'dan keyin, noaniq joyda chiqadi.
- Validation'da boshqa variable'ga murojaat — faqat Terraform 1.9+ da ishlaydi.
- `description` yozmaslik — modul foydalanuvchisi nima berishni bilmaydi.

**Senior nuqta:** Aniq turlar va validation — modulning "kontrakti". Xato apply'da emas, plan'da tushunarli xabar bilan chiqsin.

34276.a:
**Qisqa javob:** `template` moduli Jinja2 shablonidan (`.j2` fayl) har bir server uchun o'zgaruvchilar qo'yilgan haqiqiy config fayl yaratadi va uni serverga yozadi. `{{ o'zgaruvchi }}` qiymat qo'yadi, `{% for %}`/`{% if %}` sikl va shart beradi.

**Qanday ishlaydi:**
```
nginx.conf.j2 + o'zgaruvchilar (http_port=8080, inventory_hostname=web1)
       | render
       v
web1:/etc/nginx/conf.d/app.conf:  listen 8080; server_name web1;
```

**Amalda:**
```jinja
{# templates/nginx.conf.j2 #}
# {{ ansible_managed }}
server {
  listen {{ http_port | default(80) }};
  server_name {{ inventory_hostname }};

{% for loc in locations %}
  location {{ loc.path }} {
    proxy_pass http://127.0.0.1:{{ loc.port }};
  }
{% endfor %}

{% if enable_gzip %}
  gzip on;
{% endif %}
}
```
```yaml
- name: nginx site config
  ansible.builtin.template:
    src: nginx.conf.j2
    dest: /etc/nginx/conf.d/app.conf
    mode: "0644"
  notify: reload nginx
```
```yaml
# group_vars/web.yml
http_port: 8080
enable_gzip: true
locations:
  - { path: /api, port: 3000 }
```

| Modul | Qachon |
|---|---|
| `copy` | statik fayl, o'zgarishsiz |
| `template` | o'zgaruvchili, hostga moslashgan fayl |

**Tuzoqlar:**
- O'zgaruvchi aniqlanmagan — "undefined variable" xatosi; `| default(...)` ishlating.
- Template'da vaqt yoki tasodifiy qiymat — har run'da fayl "o'zgaradi" va servis bekorga reload bo'ladi.
- Murakkab mantiqni template ichiga yozish — o'qish qiyin.

**Senior nuqta:** `{{ ansible_managed }}` sarlavhasi serverda faylni qo'lda tahrirlamaslik kerakligini eslatadi — keyingi run baribir qayta yozadi.

34321.a:
**Qisqa javob:** Reverse proxy — klientlar va backend serverlar orasida turadigan server: klient proxy'ga ulanadi, proxy so'rovni ichki backend'ga uzatadi va javobni qaytaradi. Vazifalari: TLS tugatish, load balancing, marshrutlash (domen/path bo'yicha), keshlash, siqish, rate limiting, xavfsizlik header'lari, backend'larni tashqaridan yashirish. Misollar: nginx, HAProxy, Envoy, Traefik, Caddy, K8s ingress controller'lar.

**Farq:** forward proxy — klient tomonida (foydalanuvchilar internetga chiqishi uchun); reverse proxy — server tomonida (internet sizning servislaringizga kirishi uchun).

**Qanday ishlaydi:**
```
client --HTTPS--> [reverse proxy :443]
                     | TLS tugatish, rate limit, header'lar
                     +--/api--> api-1:8080, api-2:8080 (LB)
                     +--/   --> web:3000
                     +--/static -> kesh
Backend'lar private tarmoqda, faqat proxy ularga ulanadi.
```

**Amalda:**
```nginx
upstream api { server 10.0.2.11:8080; server 10.0.2.12:8080; keepalive 32; }
server {
  listen 443 ssl;
  server_name shop.example.com;
  location /api/ {
    proxy_pass http://api;
    proxy_http_version 1.1;
    proxy_set_header Connection "";
    proxy_set_header Host $host;
    proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;
    proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto $scheme;
  }
}
```
```bash
nginx -t && systemctl reload nginx
```

**Tuzoqlar:**
- `X-Forwarded-*` header'larsiz backend klient IP'si va HTTPS ekanini bilmaydi (redirect sikllari, noto'g'ri log).
- Proxy va backend timeout'lari mos emas — 502/504.
- Proxy — yagona nosozlik nuqtasi; kamida ikki nusxa yoki managed LB.
- Backend'larga tashqaridan to'g'ridan kirish ham ochiq qolgan — proxy'ni chetlab o'tib himoya qatlamlarini aylanib o'tish mumkin.

**Senior nuqta:** Reverse proxy — kesishuvchi vazifalar (TLS, auth, rate limit, observability) uchun tabiiy joy; lekin ko'p biznes mantiqini u yerga qo'ymang — konfiguratsiya kodga aylanib, test qilish qiyinlashadi.

34332.a:
**Qisqa javob:** Oddiy reverse proxy: `server` blokida `listen` va `server_name`, `location /` ichida `proxy_pass http://backend;` va to'g'ri header'lar (`Host`, `X-Real-IP`, `X-Forwarded-For`, `X-Forwarded-Proto`). Keyin `nginx -t` bilan tekshirish va `reload`.

**Muammo:** ilova 127.0.0.1:3000 da ishlaydi, uni 80/443 portda domen orqali ochish, TLS va bir nechta ilovani bitta serverda xizmat qilish kerak.

**Qanday ishlaydi:**
```
client -> nginx :80/:443 (server_name bo'yicha tanlaydi)
            location /     -> proxy_pass http://127.0.0.1:3000
            location /api/ -> proxy_pass http://127.0.0.1:8080
```

**Amalda:**
```nginx
# /etc/nginx/conf.d/app.conf
upstream app_backend {
    server 127.0.0.1:3000;
    keepalive 16;
}
server {
    listen 80;
    server_name app.example.com;

    client_max_body_size 10m;

    location / {
        proxy_pass http://app_backend;
        proxy_http_version 1.1;
        proxy_set_header Connection "";
        proxy_set_header Host $host;
        proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto $scheme;
        proxy_connect_timeout 5s;
        proxy_read_timeout 60s;
    }
}
```
```bash
sudo nginx -t                    # sintaksis tekshiruvi
sudo systemctl reload nginx      # uzilishsiz qayta yuklash
curl -H 'Host: app.example.com' http://127.0.0.1/
tail -f /var/log/nginx/error.log
```

**Tuzoqlar:**
- `proxy_pass http://backend/;` (oxirida `/` bilan) va `/` siz farqli: birinchisi `location` prefiksini olib tashlaydi. `/api/` uchun ehtiyot bo'ling.
- WebSocket uchun `Upgrade` va `Connection "upgrade"` header'lari kerak.
- SELinux yoqilgan tizimda nginx tarmoqqa ulana olmaydi — `setsebool -P httpd_can_network_connect 1`.
- `restart` o'rniga `reload` — faol ulanishlar uzilmaydi.

**Senior nuqta:** Konfiguratsiyani Git'da saqlang va CI'da `nginx -t` (container ichida) bilan tekshiring. Ko'p servis bo'lsa — K8s ingress yoki Caddy/Traefik avtomatik TLS bilan qo'lda boshqaruvni kamaytiradi.
